### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### 1. Listar todos los planes de estudio
GET {{baseUrl}}/study-plan/

### 2. Consultar plan de estudio por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/study-plan/{{planId}}

### 3. Crear nuevo plan de estudio (con enums StudyLevel y StudySystem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/study-plan/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "studyPlan": "Plan de Estudios 2024",
    "semesters": 8,
    "level": "LICENCIATURA",
    "system": "ESCOLARIZADO",
    "totalCredits": 380,
    "optionalCredits": 48,
    "firstGeneration": 2024
}

### 4. Actualizar plan de estudio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/study-plan/{{planId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "totalCredits": 390
}

### 5. Eliminar plan de estudio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/study-plan/{{planId}}
